---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | D&D Land Works"
  description="Privacy Policy for D&D Land Works LLC — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">

      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Effective Date: November 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">

        <p>D&amp;D Land Works LLC ("D&amp;D Land Works," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect personal information when you visit ddlandworksllc.com or contact us about excavation and site work services.</p>
        <p>By using the Website, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p>

        <hr />

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you provide to us.</strong> When you fill out an estimate request or contact form, call, text, or email us, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Phone number</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Property address, town, or area</li>
          <li>Project type and project details</li>
          <li>Photos or files you send us</li>
          <li>Any other information you choose to share</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit the Website, we and our service providers may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IP address and approximate location (city or region)</li>
          <li>Browser type, device type, and operating system</li>
          <li>Pages viewed, time spent on pages, and links clicked</li>
          <li>The website or search that referred you to us</li>
          <li>Date and time of your visit</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This information is collected through cookies, pixels, and similar technologies.</p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your questions and estimate requests</li>
          <li>Schedule site visits and provide estimates</li>
          <li>Provide, manage, and invoice our services</li>
          <li>Send appointment reminders and project updates</li>
          <li>Improve the Website and understand how visitors use it</li>
          <li>Measure the performance of our advertising</li>
          <li>Protect the Website against fraud, spam, and abuse</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Text messaging</h2>
        <p>If you provide your mobile number and agree to receive text messages, we may text you about your estimate, appointment, or project. Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Reply STOP to opt out at any time or HELP for help.</p>
        <p>We do not sell or share your mobile number or text messaging consent with third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
        <p>The Website may use cookies and similar tools, including Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, and advertising pixels, to understand site traffic and measure our marketing.</p>
        <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Some parts of the Website may not work properly if cookies are disabled. You can opt out of Google Analytics at <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.</p>

        <h2>How we share your information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share it only:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>With service providers who help us run our business — website hosting, form and CRM software, email, phone, scheduling, analytics, and payment processing. They may use your information only to perform services for us.</li>
          <li>With subcontractors or suppliers when needed to complete your project.</li>
          <li>For legal reasons, when required by law, subpoena, or court order, or to protect our rights, property, or safety or that of others.</li>
          <li>In a business transfer, such as a merger, sale, or transfer of business assets.</li>
          <li>With your consent, or at your direction.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>We keep personal information only as long as needed to respond to you, provide services, keep business and tax records, resolve disputes, and meet legal requirements.</p>

        <h2>Data security</h2>
        <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect your information. No website or method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.</p>
        <p>If a data breach involving your personal information occurs, we will notify you as required by Oregon law and other applicable laws.</p>

        <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Ask us to correct inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Ask us to delete your information, subject to legal and business record requirements</li>
          <li>Opt out of marketing emails or text messages</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Depending on where you live, state privacy laws, including the Oregon Consumer Privacy Act, may give you additional rights.</p>

        <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>The Website is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has given us personal information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

        <h2>Third-party links</h2>
        <p>The Website may link to other websites, such as Google, Facebook, or the Oregon Construction Contractors Board. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those websites.</p>

        <h2>Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted on this page with a new Effective Date.</p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>D&amp;D Land Works LLC</strong><br />
          Phone: <a href="tel:5414018726">541-401-8726</a><br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:david@ddlandworks.com">david@ddlandworks.com</a><br />
          Oregon CCB #261742
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
